NOTE roster-expectations what="After R10 the orchestrator roster sweep should observe — SPINNING PROPS: stunt1-4 (stunt_plane.glb, isStuntVariant extraction), tucano (colombian_emb_314_tucano.glb, named 'Propeller'), p100 (p-100_avenger_-_free.glb, named 'Avenger rotor_9'), lowpolytrainer (low_poly_plane.glb, named 'Propeller'). EXTRACTED-OR-STATIC per new confidence gate (P3): dusty, corsair, macchi, yak9, ripslinger — each spins ONLY if its extracted cluster passes perp+nearNose+axis, else logs 'REJECTED' and stays static (acceptable, no wrong spin). NO PROP (jetSwap): f-15, low_poly_f-15, a-10 avion. WORKING GEAR (DOWN/UP on G): stunt1-4 ('SM_Veh_Plane_Stunt_01_Wheels'), tucano ('Wheel/WheelBox/WheelL/WheelR'), p100 ('Avenger wheels_11'), lowpolytrainer ('FrontWheel/LeftWheel/RightWheel'). FIXED (no gear nodes): dusty, corsair, macchi, yak9, ripslinger, f-15, low_poly_f-15, a-10. Wire-compat: any plane with glbGear null behaves exactly as pre-R10 fixed-gear."
